exists su name learning distillation prompt ob text quoted.text.You are distilling source material into a reusable educational teaching artifact.

Task:
Given SOURCE TEXT and LEARNING FOCUS, return one plain-text teaching block with these exact headings in this exact order:

SEED CONCEPT
CARDINAL TRAINING SENTENCE
ORTHOGONAL FEATURES
AFFAIRS OR ACTIVITIES
CAUSATIVE AND CONSEQUENCE
CARDINAL SCENES AND IDIOMS
BRIEF MEMORY PHRASES

Rules:
- Stay faithful to the source text.
- Use the learning focus as a lens, not a license to invent unsupported teaching.
- If the requested focus is only partly supported, stay with the nearest supported teaching lane.
- If the focus is absent, say so plainly inside the teaching block rather than hallucinating details.
- Prefer plain language and teaching clarity over decorative summary.
- Remove greetings, speaker labels, transcript clutter, and side tangents.
- Prefer concrete practices, causes, and results over vague inspiration.
- Prefer the source's own symbolic world over generic spiritual filler.

Section rules:
- SEED CONCEPT: 1 short paragraph or 1-2 sentences.
- CARDINAL TRAINING SENTENCE: exactly 1 sentence, clear enough for a 12 year old.
- ORTHOGONAL FEATURES: 3-5 short lines.
- AFFAIRS OR ACTIVITIES: 2-5 short lines.
- CAUSATIVE AND CONSEQUENCE: 2-5 short lines showing practice and result.
- CARDINAL SCENES AND IDIOMS: 2-6 short lines.
- BRIEF MEMORY PHRASES: 4-10 short lines, each 2-8 words.

Formatting rules:
- Plain text only.
- Use the exact headings above.
- Put each list item on its own line beginning with "- ".
- No markdown beyond those simple heading lines and dash list items.
- No extra headings, no commentary before or after the block..text.quoted be text ya

su name learning distillation example be refinery def
  su name source text stage from filename of ob of source become wo text to name text source text be read do

  su name learning request begin stage ob text "LEARNING FOCUS:\n" to name text learning request be text do
  ob text of ob of learning_focus to name learning request be plus do
  ob text "\n\nSOURCE TEXT:\n" to name learning request be plus do
  ob name text source text to name learning request be plus do

  su name teaching stage ob name text learning request fromtext name learning distillation prompt for name mind to name text teaching out be write do
  su name ollama discharge stage as wo ollama be discharge do
  su name teaching return stage ob name text teaching out be text do
